    "version": 1,
    "id": "8086-stack",
    "title": "8086 Swap using the stack",
    "description": "Level: beginner. Swap BX and CX using PUSH and POP. Restore SP. Finish with HLT. Cases set BX and CX. Checks include registers and the two stack words in SS=0700h.",
    "architecture": "8086",
    "starter_code": "org 100h\n; TODO: exchange BX and CX using PUSH and POP\nhlt\n",
    "step_limit": 10000,
    "time_limit_ms": 1000,
    "hint": "The last pushed word is popped first. Two PUSH must be balanced by two POP.",
    "cases": [
      {
